%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a quarter turn from rounding. Under an anisotropic scale
% this `arcto` sweeps a right angle recomputed from the current point
% read back through the CTM, which lands within rounding of 90 degrees
% on either side; the arc is one Bezier piece either way, so the IR
% carries a single curve after the line to the first tangent point.
<< /PageSize [300 300] >> setpagedevice
-45 rotate
0.80 0.89 scale
1.50 1.16 scale
7 8 moveto 23 8 23 57 45 arcto pop pop pop pop
stroke
showpage
